Get Out and Vote
I believe our district&rsquo;s best days are ahead of us. That is only going to happen, however, with the right leadership. With Eric Sorensen, the writing is on the wall &ndash; the only thing he cares about is protecting his own job. It&rsquo;s time for a new direction. Early voting has started and I humbly ask that you get out and vote for me; and, once you do that, please encourage your friends and family to do the same.

